{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_25\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 25</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_25\">Problem 25</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 25\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cbe4b42c980d45ea132956991d3f432a054f1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_1 ( x )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb0e5c38f70bf27f9973db7f0469d36033d4f709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are the quotient and remainder, respectively, when the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff054a4f4950f855a17ffa80f24fd1dbd5176c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^ 8$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> is divided by \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/618bd779ecae625d40d02dc44c6468536f050fd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"21\" /> , and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a8d4fa2c58668c5fe1172d869948750fc72266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_ 2 ( x )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4f3f4b698ce35667432041e168f7653533fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> are the quotient and remainder, respectively, \nwhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50ce15d2628de49eddd441e0fbaa2b74417187b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_ 1 ( x )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/618bd779ecae625d40d02dc44c6468536f050fd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4f3f4b698ce35667432041e168f7653533fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/053e50161a05431d19a80bfecd7e080151b35dd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{256}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-\\frac{1}{16}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }-16\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"459\" height=\"37\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>First, we divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c777b753a5ddb9e42e9f6065680e66b1c5c49b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^8$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/4/76412713efa38b264a2d2beee2c290c374b90249.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> using synthetic division or some other method. The quotient is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f82051ce0b83c6eb2b31210c1d3756b85ddc88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^7-\\frac{1}{2}x^6+\\frac{1}{4}x^5-\\frac{1}{8}x^4+\\frac{1}{16}x^3-\\frac{1}{32}x^2+\\frac{1}{64}x-\\frac{1}{128}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"408\" height=\"37\" />, and the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c6b95caf46bdab254d985202e5ef3a8f1003cde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{256}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"29\" height=\"37\" />. Then we plug the solution to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d3cd8acbd449cc2105518bac86ce22aecd5feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{1}{2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" /> into the quotient to find the remainder. Notice that every term in the quotient, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2ba57c2738a318a9a95c1a2a53691ee1581875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />, evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac47e5f02ec0d259d22795389c9dcb04f84dfd76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{128}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/07837958ed5e8b778b87057921a83ac201926bb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2 =-\\frac{8}{128} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } -\\frac{1}{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the remainder theorem, we see that the remainder upon dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c777b753a5ddb9e42e9f6065680e66b1c5c49b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^8$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/4/76412713efa38b264a2d2beee2c290c374b90249.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16fab882a5e358665463c078b835d22dc323e8d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^8 = \\frac{1}{256}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"123\" height=\"48\" /> Thus, we have that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4d0a22663c08f4eab20f87039c8670de9e3151.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^8 = \\left(x+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)Q(x) + \\frac{1}{256}.\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"43\" />\nIsolating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/33858669e5e3b3881f3340f70da302513aa840f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"20\" /> we see\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa5c57f30b168e462c400c33cb37b9e27f5678d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^8-\\frac{1}{256}}{x+\\frac{1}{2}} = Q(x).\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"47\" />\nUsing the difference of squares factorization repeatedly, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9ecda94397634c5329fc161d93193faf0bc5fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{2^2}\\right)\\left(x^4+\\frac{1}{2^4}\\right)}{x+\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{2^2}\\right)\\left(x^4+\\frac{1}{2^4}\\right)=Q(x).\\]\" width=\"619\" height=\"48\" />\nFinally, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2ba57c2738a318a9a95c1a2a53691ee1581875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" /> again, the final answer is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54fbe373414271f52c95325cbb8f9cc0850a805e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-1)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd6dd60d0f1b02b67f9e965cc8c4f86321cebc89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\boxed{-\\frac{1}{16}}.\\]\" width=\"69\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~anduran\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016222726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 211/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5516/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.332      1 -total\n 61.37%    8.182      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 37.01%    4.934      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15284:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016222726 and revision id 225998. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}